+     * Turnip writes no metadata there at all, that path being a CCU flush and
+     * nothing else (tu_cmd_buffer.cc:9997-10011). Turnip's mirror of the problem
+     * is a UBWC image *reading* a previous tenant's bytes as flag data, which is
+     * why it refuses UBWC under sparse residency in its own words, "unbound
+     * blocks may have leftover fast-clear data" (tu_image.cc:338-343). That is a
